        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Calls down a barrage of arcane energy, slowing and dealing magic damage to all enemies in an area. Targets in the middle receive additional damage and a stronger slow.",
        "bodyHtml": "Xerath calls down a blast of arcane energy, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/85/120/155/190 + (65% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 25% for 2.5 seconds. Enemies in the center take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(83.35/141.695/200.04/258.385/316.73 + (108.355% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> instead and are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 60/65/70/75/80%, decaying over 2.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Empowered <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> decays down to 25%.</span>",
